      "sourceTextSha256": "f703af8733f9924a8f9cd1be1f3328a6e54b1d907c44079c21c6a1eaed792869",
      "text": "After breakfast, depart for Soberanía National Park, one of Panama’s most important rainforest reserves and a prime area for observing tropical wildlife and birdlife. \n\nContinue to the Rainforest Discovery Center, where you will explore the rainforest through its trails and observation tower, surrounded by the rich biodiversity of the Panama Canal watershed.\n\nContinue to Gamboa, located at the meeting point of the Chagres River and the Panama Canal. Enjoy the natural surroundings and learn more about the rainforest ecosystem and its importance to the Canal. \n\nReturn to Gamboa hotel.\n\nOVERNIGHT\n\nGamboa",
