    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4b4b16ad6c171f6214ac1fb056abeb66a68a93b764cf39d9ad3936ce8234b0cc",
      "text": "After breakfast, depart for Gamboa for a boat excursion on Gatun Lake, one of the largest artificial lakes in the world and an essential part of the Panama Canal waterway.\n\nCruise through the lake and observe ships navigating the Canal while exploring the surrounding rainforest. Continue towards Monkey Island, where you may encounter several species of monkeys and other wildlife in their natural environment. The excursion offers a unique combination of wildlife observation, rainforest scenery and Panama Canal experiences.\n\nReturn to Panama City in the afternoon.\n\nOVERNIGHT\n\nPanama City",
